FFFFF;"> <h1><span>BIRDS-025：連環食虫</span></h1> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+需要機密權限</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-存取完畢</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p><strong>產物名：</strong>食人族產生鏈</p> <p><strong>階段：</strong>籠中鳥</p> <p><strong>殺傷力：</strong>雁</p> <p><strong>用途：</strong>利用食物鏈使害蟲人口罹患&quot;食人症&quot;。</p> <strong>詳細資料：</strong><a href="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/birds-025">點此</a>查看日文存檔。<br /> <br /> <strong>部署記錄：</strong><br /> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th colspan="3"><strong>日本北海道地區部署實驗紀錄</strong></th> </tr> <tr> <th>年次</th> <th>施放隻數</th> <th>害蟲人口死亡數</th> </tr> <tr> <td>18</td> <td>100</td> <td>54</td> </tr> <tr> <td>20</td> <td>200</td> <td>205</td> </tr> <tr> <td>22</td> <td>500</td> <td>1,677</td> </tr> <tr> <td>24</td> <td>1,000</td> <td>19,944</td> </tr> </table> <blockquote> <p><em>事情後來的發展真是出乎意料，這就是生態系偉大的適應能力嗎？簡直是開玩笑啊&#8230;——築巢者Theta</em></p> </blockquote> <p><strong>敵對勢力相關資料：</strong>[尚未取得]</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <br /></div> <hr /> <div class="content-panel standalone series" style="background-color: #FFFFFF;"> <h1><span>BIRDS-026：共命之鳥</span></h1> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+需要機密權限</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-存取完畢</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p><strong>產物名：</strong>自殺雉雞</p> <p><strong>階段：</strong>墮落鳥</p> <p><strong>殺傷力：</strong>隼</p> <p><strong>用途：</strong>影響範圍內的人自殺。</p> <p><strong>詳細資料：</strong><a href="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/birds-026">點此</a>查看日文存檔。<br /> <br /> <strong>部署記錄：</strong><br /></p